## AggregateExec Partial and Final
  case default: no violations
  case single partition: no violations
  case inexact statistics: no violations
  case absent statistics: no violations
  case empty input: no violations
  case uniform constants: no violations
  case constants per partition: no violations
  case copied columns: no violations
  case sorted by row id: no violations
  case hash partitioned: no violations

