## AggregateExec Single with DISTINCT limit
  allowed batch_boundary_invariance: the limit is a soft limit: the aggregate stops after the input batch in which it has seen 5 groups, so how many and which groups it emits depends on batch boundaries, and only the LIMIT above it makes the result well defined (aggregates/mod.rs:859-864); it reports no fetch, so the check cannot know that
